# Flutter's template ignores the keystore here — this repo commits it
# instead, deliberately. It is private, and losing dastyor-release.jks
# means never being able to ship an update to the published app again
# (Play Store rejects a build signed with a different key).
# See https://flutter.dev/to/reference-keystore
